{"steam_appid":1425760,"steam_name":"Pulling No Punches","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1425760/486738/f041794ee31293f469ec4ade8bd758f80b741339/1751236618/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1684044124","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256900309/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1684044124","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/ss_6c7598a166de2876f5e60ee6f0e3e021fc4acd90.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779656827","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/ss_e66d7b5d837af9d8dac2beaa5e13e2cafc5bca53.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779656827","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/ss_cf40586d34bf4b25bf035c4cb1c30a78b23142f0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779656827","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/ss_1b0b1c626360dbcff6ba21514f0ba5d1d290c18f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779656827","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/ss_588d4c41f3e24839351ecdb0fc7a8a2e565b03ce.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779656827"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/6f6c3afbe10c726014cbca82a1c325c6.poster.avif?t=1779656827\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/6f6c3afbe10c726014cbca82a1c325c6.webm?t=1779656827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/6f6c3afbe10c726014cbca82a1c325c6.mp4?t=1779656827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pulling No Punches is a satirical game in the 2D beat'em up style with classic arcade influences and modern visuals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/f79fe232af72582d0a52b0b31991bc38.webp?t=1779656827\" width=612 height=40 /></span><br><br>The game follows the fictional story of a global pandemic that engulfed the world and is being ignored by fanatics who do not believe that the disease is real. It is up to the main characters, 4 common citizens adequately protected with gloves and masks, to deal with these fanatics and solve the situation with the force of their own fists.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/e9b1f5585889d3ce395ebdf7ce87dd5e.poster.avif?t=1779656827\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/e9b1f5585889d3ce395ebdf7ce87dd5e.webm?t=1779656827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/e9b1f5585889d3ce395ebdf7ce87dd5e.mp4?t=1779656827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425760/extras/4b4bf2f259e4fc7ad132fdb0b9522be6.webp?t=1779656827\" width=612 height=40 /></span><br><br>● 4 Co-op Local Multiplayer!<br>● 4 Characters with unique Unlockables and Moves!<br>● Use everything at your disposal to destroy your enemies: a wide variety of punches, kicks, grabs and headbutts!<br>● Handmade art painfully animated frame by frame!","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> At least 1GB Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie"],"developers":["BrainDead Broccoli"],"publishers":["BrainDead Broccoli","QUByte Interactive"],"release_date":"10 Aug, 2022"}